INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Ancient Sith civilization: origins and identity','history-ancient-sith-civilization','Continuity: Legends. The Sith were originally a people as well as the name of a later religious and political tradition. Tales of the Jedi explores the ancient empire and its conflicts with the Republic. Distinguish ancestry, political citizenship and allegiance to the Sith Order; these are not interchangeable. Research starting point: Tales of the Jedi: The Golden Age of the Sith.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='galactic-history' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'The Great Hyperspace War','history-great-hyperspace-war','Continuity: Legends. The conflict connects the ancient Sith Empire with the Republic through the discovery of hyperspace routes. Naga Sadow and Ludo Kressh represent competing approaches to leadership. Study the role of internal rivalry and expansion in the empire''s collapse. Reading starting point: Tales of the Jedi: The Fall of the Sith Empire.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='galactic-history' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Character dossier: Naga Sadow','character-naga-sadow','Continuity: Legends. Naga Sadow is a Sith Lord associated with the Great Hyperspace War and later with Yavin 4. His rivalry with Ludo Kressh illustrates competing ambitions within the ancient empire. Study his portrayal in Tales of the Jedi, distinguishing political ambition from the supernatural abilities attributed to him in fiction.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Character dossier: Exar Kun','character-exar-kun','Continuity: Legends. Exar Kun begins as a Jedi and becomes a Sith Lord whose actions contribute to the Great Sith War. His story connects forbidden knowledge, pride and the exploitation of followers. Tales of the Jedi and the Jedi Academy trilogy provide different stages of his fictional history. Reflection: how can intellectual curiosity remain accountable?',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Character dossier: Revan','character-revan','Continuity: primarily Legends. Knights of the Old Republic presents Revan through a story of war, identity, memory and moral choice. Later Legends works develop that biography further. The name Revan has a Canon reference, but that does not establish the entire game narrative as Canon. Study the difference between personal identity and institutional labels.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Character dossier: Darth Traya','character-darth-traya','Continuity: Legends. Kreia, also known as Darth Traya, is central to Knights of the Old Republic II. Her critique of dependence on the Force and her complicated mentorship invite questions about autonomy, manipulation and the limits of moral certainty. Her arguments are fictional philosophical material, not unquestionable spiritual authority.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Jedi lineage: Yoda, Dooku, Qui-Gon and Obi-Wan','jedi-lineage-dooku','Continuity: Canon. Dooku trained under Yoda, Qui-Gon under Dooku, and Obi-Wan under Qui-Gon. Their differing judgments show that apprenticeship does not guarantee agreement. Dooku''s departure and later allegiance to the Sith contrast with Qui-Gon''s independent commitment to Jedi life. Research starting points: the prequel films, Tales of the Jedi and Dooku: Jedi Lost.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='jedi-temple' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Jedi lineage: Obi-Wan, Anakin and Ahsoka','jedi-lineage-anakin','Continuity: Canon. Obi-Wan trains Anakin, who later mentors Ahsoka during the Clone Wars. Their relationships explore responsibility, loyalty and the consequences of institutional failure. Ahsoka''s departure from the Order demonstrates that leaving an institution does not necessarily mean abandoning its values. Study the films and The Clone Wars.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='jedi-temple' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Sacred locations: Ahch-To','location-ahch-to','Continuity: Canon. Ahch-To is associated with an ancient Jedi temple and Luke Skywalker''s exile in the sequel trilogy. Its island setting and surviving texts invite reflection on preservation, failure and renewal. Study The Last Jedi. A living community may use the location symbolically without claiming that it exists on Earth.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Sacred locations: Moraband and Korriban','location-moraband-korriban','Continuity distinction: Moraband appears in The Clone Wars as an ancient Sith world; Korriban is the familiar name in Legends accounts. Treat continuity-specific geography and history separately. The tombs symbolize memory, power and mortality. Research starting points: The Clone Wars season six and Tales of the Jedi.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Artifacts: Jedi and Sith holocrons','artifact-holocron-reference','Holocrons are fictional repositories of knowledge associated with Force traditions. The Clone Wars and Rebels depict them as important objects of study and conflict. Their access rules and capabilities depend on the story. For Knightfall, a holocron can serve as a metaphor for a curated archive, with provenance, revision history and responsible access.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO threads(category_id,user_id,title,slug,body,pinned) SELECT c.id,u.id,'Artifacts: the Darksaber','artifact-darksaber','Continuity: Canon. The Darksaber is associated with Tarre Vizsla and Mandalorian history. Its changing ownership becomes entangled with political legitimacy in The Clone Wars, Rebels and The Mandalorian. Study how symbols acquire authority through collective belief, and distinguish possession of an object from legitimate leadership.',0 FROM categories c CROSS JOIN users u WHERE c.slug='holocron-archives' AND u.username='knightfall' AND u.role='god';